# --- The published raptor weights: VOID, and not on a threshold. -------------------------------------
# His script defaults --folds 0, the fold hook fires only above zero, and the TYPICAL RUN block his
# released arms used passes no --folds at all. These are released weights read on studies they trained
# on - foreign_overlap priced the set at 98.6% in-sample. All five share raptor_v4_swa's exact 909-row
# study set, which is how the verdict carries verbatim to each. A ruler change cannot repair
# in-sample-ness, so the readings below are the SIZE OF THE MIRAGE and nothing else.
