# --- The honest cross-trunk family: NOT declined on merit. It cannot reach the roster. ----------------
# hisrecipe_distill is a RECIPE we own, run on OUR studies with OUR fold held out -
# logs/hisrecipe_distill.launch2.log:21 reads [cv] fold 0/1: train 3453 | OOF held-out 896, and
# experiments/arms/hisrecipe_distill.sh:41 carries --arch coatnet_rmlp_2_rw_384 --fold 0 --fold_file.
# repl2x2 is the same lineage via experiments/after_cellc.sh:41. D145 measures every one of the nine at
# +0.0019..+0.0031 of SWAP value into honest12 / twin5 / twin6 - three of three rosters - and D146
# section 3 prices all nine to within +0.0004 with the two-variable D35 model that was fitted before they
# existed. These are the best seat candidates the project has ever measured, and they are written HERE
# only because package_members ships checkpoints and they have none locally: the roster cannot reach
# them, the kernel's foreign-seat path can. THE DECLINE IS OF THE ROSTER PATH. Do not read a line in this
# file as a verdict on these nine.
#
# TWO MEMBERS WEARING NINE NAMES (D147 section 2b). Within-family nn-corr is 0.988 to 0.9997 -
# hisrecipe_swa and _epens sit at 0.9997, which is a rounding difference and not a member. And the two
# FAMILIES collapse onto each other: cross-family corr 0.89-0.91, so once repl2x2_c is seated the best
# hisrecipe adds +0.0004 to +0.0007, under the 0.0020 board blur, under the 0.0025 paired resolution and
# under the 0.0062 family noise floor. SEAT EXACTLY ONE. The seven non-shipped variants below are
# declined as near-duplicates, which is not a quality argument - they are the same member.
raptor_ft_repl2x2_c.pt               # LEDGER75 0.8791, 896 rows - swap +0.0027/+0.0030/+0.0026, nn-corr
# 0.8231 (2.6th percentile of a pool whose median is 0.9161), z +6.43 against the all-ours residual
# spread, 0 of 182 all-ours candidates matching. THE SEATED ONE. It is below the 0.89 solo bar and pays
# more than our 0.8959 best member on two of three rosters, which is the measurement that established the
# bar is D35 with its correlation term deleted (D146 section 3). Its D36 pre-registration
# (experiments/repl2x2_c.prereg.md) called solo 0.8787, corr 0.830 and seat +0.0027 three weeks early and
# matches to 4dp - an independent reproduction, and the strongest single item in the Commission C file.
